# Config
config.nether_api.compat.betternether.betterMushroomModels=3D Vanilla Mushroom Models
config.nether_api.compat.betternether.betterMushroomModels.tooltip=While enabled, the vanilla red mushroom and brown mushroom plants use BetterNether's 3D models.\n- Always: 3D models are always used.\n- Nether: 3D models are only used in the nether.\n- Biome: 3D models are only used in BetterNether biomes.\n- Never: 3D models are never used.
config.nether_api.compat.betternether.moldOnMyceliumOnly=Only Mycelium Supports Mold
config.nether_api.compat.betternether.moldOnMyceliumOnly.tooltip=Whether the nether mold plants can only be planted on mycelium-like blocks. This is the default behavior for BetterNether.
config.nether_api.compat.betternether.visceralEyeGen=Visceral Heap Eyeball Vine Frequency
config.nether_api.compat.betternether.visceralEyeGen.tooltip=While the Biomes O' Plenty mod is installed, Nether API allows BetterNether's Eyeball Vine plants to also generate inside Biomes O' Plenty's Visceral Heap nether biome. This setting controls the chance of an Eyeball Vine generating for each ceiling block in a Visceral Heap biome.
